sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant AuthService
    participant Backend

    User->>Frontend: Digita email e senha
    Frontend->>AuthService: login({email, password})
    AuthService->>Backend: POST /users/login
    Backend-->>AuthService: token JWT
    AuthService-->>Frontend: token armazenado
    Frontend-->>User: Login realizado com sucesso
